 "build": {
  "id": "f1209da4-7416-49df-b18a-b6f14fb4de1c",
  "title": "Godblade Big Bonk Build",
  "description": "[overview]\nWorks well both if PvP and PvE. Few tweaks could be done to optimize for PVE.\n\n[talents]\nWe take damage reductions nodes to better survive incoming damage passively and gives us chance to offheal some of incoming damage. \n\nVoidborne is a pretty solid offensive cooldown, 20 seconds of stun immunity is crazy. Could opt into Nutcase and Book of N'Zoth for move passive damage, but having good CDs is important in PvP.\n\n[rotation]\nIn PvP, try to manage insanity so that we dont go into the 50% More damage taken state. You can purposly go over 100 insanity if you have End Times up vs other Melee classes.\n\nRifted Hammers of twilight will do most of our damage, so try to reduce it´s cd whenevers possible.\n\nIn PvE, try to go insane as often as possible, build up insanity as the pack gathers, Rift + HoT on cd, and otherwise spam Entropic slam or Hot in single target.\n\nUse Voidborne on CD\n\n[stats]\nStr/Crit>Int>Agi\n\n[gear]\nBig damage slow 2h weapon for big bonks\n\n[tips]\nEnjoy bonking, use your Cds often!",
  "class_id": 25,
  "spec_id": 64,
